notes[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-29T19:54:12.169Z",codex-coverage-inventory,"Scope: consolidate fixture source reports around the gates emitted include arguments while retaining independent real-c8 pass/fail fixtures. Deduplicate and sort overlapping source roots. Update exact published CLI/SDK pin to 2026.9.29. Depends on parent TSX-gate candidate PR132. Rollout: reviewed source PR only, no publication/deployment. Rollback: revert this change; thresholds/exemptions remain unchanged."
  "2026-09-29T20:01:49.136Z",codex-coverage-inventory,"Red-green evidence: duplicate-root regression failed with four include entries instead of two. Real child c8 initially inherited Node test-worker context and skipped execution; standalone child environment now executes its real assertions. Full release gate then exposed c8 inheriting and cleaning parent NODE_V8_COVERAGE counters, yielding incomplete aggregate coverage. Added a red runner-argument regression and pinned each gate to its repository-owned coverage/tmp. Exact development-version assertion updated alongside the published CLI pin; thresholds unchanged."
  "2026-09-29T20:12:55.278Z",codex-coverage-inventory,"Validated source candidate: npm ci and exact CLI/SDK 2026.9.29 pin pass. Full release:check with real pm-slack and pm-csv selections passes 456/456 tests, zero skips/TODOs, c8 per-file 100 statements/branches/functions/lines across 23 runtime/tooling/template files, 221 selected documented declarations, zero duplication across 43 sources and zero full/production dependency audit findings. PM-linked none/snapshot acceptance passes 11 tests. The default suite still skips two opt-in live-fleet checks. Independent full documentation presence census is 580/1879 declarations and 22/23 module docblocks, tracked by ops-0c8k. Selected docstring gate success is not full documentation coverage. No publication or deployment is authorized by these measurements."
